# R-Type Delta: HD Boosted (PPSA26414) -- EXPLORATORY arm v2 (OPTIONS to leave the title, then Cross only).
#
# MEASURED on arm v1 (options+cross mash, 2026-08-20): with OPTIONS in the route the boot reaches the
# menu system by t=12 s, and v1 then never advanced past the first two menu states -- it oscillated
# between "Start Game" and "Select Slot to Create" with a 15 s period, three times its own 5 s cycle.
# This file is v1 with OPTIONS removed after t=7 s; it walks the whole flow into stage 1. Those two
# arms together are the evidence that OPTIONS UNDOES menu progress and must stop after the title.
#
# Anchors are SECONDS from the FIRST PAD POLL (prosper/src/input/pad.cpp: a bare number is seconds,
# 'f' is flips, 'p' is pad reads).
